March 11, 2026

Dear Supporter,

Despite our recent wins on the SAVE plan, SAVE is now struggling
to survive following a court decision earlier this week that puts
its fate in our hands. We must now use our last resort– the court
of public opinion– to protect the more than 7 million American
borrowers and their families who are enrolled in SAVE. We have a
small window of opportunity, so it’s time to make your voice
heard.

ADD YOUR NAME: SAVE THE SAVE PLAN 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.3mymh0y1wrIodqOdyCoj4duIb_1BmaUlZZDQ-y9VvTpdshzikI9UCrY8T9m4jZJjsHvBiqcfLt1hvRSCcIbYlA/4ou/UCHZbLVsSM6PiYAWgObQPA/t0/h001.fiAgxeAMsSrfc1uCKG8nL3OnlhKrCCie_RmMyRKU2w0 )

The Eighth Circuit Court may have blocked the SAVE plan, but
our voices are stronger. The benefits of SAVE, including
shortened loan forgiveness pathways, lower monthly payments, and
limits on interest accrual, would provide significant support at
a time when so many folks are struggling to afford rising costs
and put food on the table. Saving the SAVE plan is not optional –
it is necessary.

It is now up to all of us, whether or not we’re enrolled in SAVE,
to speak up. There is power in numbers, and we believe in
preserving plans that make monthly payments more affordable for
Americans. Add your name and stand with us. Tell the White House
to save the SAVE plan. 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.3mymh0y1wrIodqOdyCoj4duIb_1BmaUlZZDQ-y9VvTpdshzikI9UCrY8T9m4jZJjsHvBiqcfLt1hvRSCcIbYlA/4ou/UCHZbLVsSM6PiYAWgObQPA/t1/h001.20r2ntDqyWEpRmihyxQc4ikjFs4Lz9WEB5DKw6L5t_E ) We
cannot let the opportunity pass by to fight for a more affordable
future.

Together, we will end the student debt crisis,

Team SDCC

Student Debt Crisis Center (SDCC) is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit
that centers the needs and voices of borrowers, and partners with
allies, to impact public policy and end the student debt crisis.
We are a people-powered movement representing over 2 million
supporters.

Donations to SDCC are tax deductible to the full extent of the
law. 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.OU9JUeVLcHljNKW5B6v_o9iHIBxD8RohwQ0M_S3p_D_yCMxTb5JZNpoBtAntnYIJrKBh25rpi8nAqaBHWI7yoKcZ2lrFhcvUlDNe2ycR9TA/4ou/UCHZbLVsSM6PiYAWgObQPA/t2/h001.G2sHthG0O_VCCock6YFnVGz02Qc9hdJvzREnGVGpcyU )

You're receiving this message because you signed a petition
started by Student Debt Crisis Center 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.OU9JUeVLcHljNKW5B6v_o5KZsbiHqO52bdTuem6IjA8KPkth7F5mTxthSU6OxECK5YidtLhMXCkho851fARINg/4ou/UCHZbLVsSM6PiYAWgObQPA/t3/h001.vD0VpBSRnVtmkrT-TnxsMTTdEz4WbXXpAwimxLtl93o ).
