February 25, 2026

Dear Supporter,

Every person deserves to live a life of dignity, but the
affordability crisis and crushing student loan debt make that a
distant dream for struggling families. Millions of Americans are
falling behind on payments and entering default at unprecedented
rates, fearing paycheck garnishment or tax refund seizure. We
need the Department of Education to permanently end all
collections practices for Americans with student loans in
default.

ADD YOUR NAME: PERMANENTLY END DEFAULT COLLECTIONS 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.3mymh0y1wrIodqOdyCoj4duIb_1BmaUlZZDQ-y9VvTr04DlX4q897x3KCspYo5g0AOwAFBcCqZeqQwQCKKWH4IppUgia4xwvrugYa1n5UrVw2w6xp2it8Upr7yziJQzhoPabN-TqT2jg7kdX1UnakQ/4oi/DJuOj7lNSGegKAh320nOIQ/t0/h001.rJz1ttPjffOOJvQPDtlIqS8r4JfBSYlw8UyABhkfHyc )


We have heard borrowers from across the country– from senior
citizens struggling to make payments to a concerned mother unsure
how she will take care of her children – and the implications of
default are damaging. These are the individuals who can’t afford
to lose a part of their paycheck or have their tax refunds
seized. These are more than just numbers; they are human beings
who face profound harm from a broken student loan system.

Many folks in default carry a lot of shame, but the truth is,
this system is broken, and there is nothing to be ashamed of.
Take a moment to read the stories of how defaulted student loans
impact our family, friends, neighbors, and community.  
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.jaNEx5kOH0g8E9fxuB5lKvzb9pV7oiRwh-QnPwWOaHji1gk_nOqk3pk6hr4pyTWkzu64pb3RAya6HiG3LvVGodZyP1hA8DpAKpaIMWBKFGvz7dG5QttOvTlqwsxSJ936PCVuL_gxYH0PujBitEJEY6UfitCK1tf5tIt1XeK56b9BAp92LRXarTw7pFc_kJFT/4oi/DJuOj7lNSGegKAh320nOIQ/t1/h001.vDIB-HbTlRIvqgQ0pnb7z_8toddudqWhZ4kOn_Ehrus )


Help us stand up for struggling Americans and families. Add your
name now to demand a permanent end to any collection practices 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.3mymh0y1wrIodqOdyCoj4duIb_1BmaUlZZDQ-y9VvTr04DlX4q897x3KCspYo5g0AOwAFBcCqZeqQwQCKKWH4IppUgia4xwvrugYa1n5UrVw2w6xp2it8Upr7yziJQzhoPabN-TqT2jg7kdX1UnakQ/4oi/DJuOj7lNSGegKAh320nOIQ/t2/h001.MZdLLx2ZUPT6P7cEEzeBbwBMsS2_kUaU0d9AAF3Tndc )
 on Americans with defaulted student loans. We cannot afford to
let another day pass without any relief.

If your student loans are in default, please reply to this email
so we can share resources with you.

In Solidarity,

Team SDCC

