February 24, 2026

Dear Supporter,

We are just a few months away from a major student loan overhaul
that will harm millions of Americans with student loan debt, and
we are racing against the clock to stop its implementation. Here
are two things you can do right now before it is too late.

1. SEND A LETTER TO YOUR REPRESENTATIVES TO OVERTURN THE HARMFUL
STUDENT LOAN OVERHAUL 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.3mymh0y1wrIodqOdyCoj4duIb_1BmaUlZZDQ-y9VvTq9t3xk0fqzGP_fCc3msbidBib9ShRRyR4OKGQr26YHxm3bY80b1s5tkccLz64fpbE1_q_ijJWr_y0EGSKY5WDIbgzWCHPQxz7E6LzBaERPTA/4og/ePKC0YsvRqu2W0lKT02EGQ/t0/h001.oyDFZ4BvXgZ4OiC324RLUzmILQj0BvQEJUCfC0CtGkI )


2. Join Student Debt Crisis Center, Young Invincibles, and
Protect Borrowers for an Emergency Organizing Call this week 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.J07fkCO9PBGiyvO7dWTFFE1VET_Fdbuz48z_HI9Gh6cQZbRMg098Rim61PNeYt7wyzsjSU05wSxRrqeGKh6EFjUf1DtWq4sbZsW4l4dJcpetQTwagFndrFTg-hxtkFLlb28dUySGtB3CrMu1w9D6Ew/4og/ePKC0YsvRqu2W0lKT02EGQ/t1/h001.YM0AcJaPtBMsY3jFeBLq_MT4O0rwvQm0IizXMmtmzJ4 )
! We’ll discuss the many upcoming student loan changes and the
actions you can take right now.

📅 Wednesday, February 25, 2026

🕓Time: 6:00 PM ET / 3:00 PM PT

🔗Click Here to Sign Up 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.J07fkCO9PBGiyvO7dWTFFE1VET_Fdbuz48z_HI9Gh6cQZbRMg098Rim61PNeYt7wyzsjSU05wSxRrqeGKh6EFjUf1DtWq4sbZsW4l4dJcpetQTwagFndrFTg-hxtkFLlb28dUySGtB3CrMu1w9D6Ew/4og/ePKC0YsvRqu2W0lKT02EGQ/t2/h001.9Uc1xm_6u9kYud3IVCbdyN8qMNUWsMkSbUZkhdmpsMU )


Time is running out! The Department of Education has released
finalized regulations and is accepting public comments until
March 2nd. This is your chance to learn how the law impacts you
and how to advocate for yourself.

By sending a letter 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.3mymh0y1wrIodqOdyCoj4duIb_1BmaUlZZDQ-y9VvTq9t3xk0fqzGP_fCc3msbidBib9ShRRyR4OKGQr26YHxm3bY80b1s5tkccLz64fpbE1_q_ijJWr_y0EGSKY5WDIbgzWCHPQxz7E6LzBaERPTA/4og/ePKC0YsvRqu2W0lKT02EGQ/t3/h001.Q3RGtl95mRSd-_OS2Nsz05a4gFJvYJ2CgkSJOp70niI )
 and signing up for this Emergency Organizing Call 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.J07fkCO9PBGiyvO7dWTFFE1VET_Fdbuz48z_HI9Gh6cQZbRMg098Rim61PNeYt7wyzsjSU05wSxRrqeGKh6EFjUf1DtWq4sbZsW4l4dJcpetQTwagFndrFTg-hxtkFLlb28dUySGtB3CrMu1w9D6Ew/4og/ePKC0YsvRqu2W0lKT02EGQ/t4/h001.7YBgGblwD5fJNhFXnvnyqq_SR9tiQcH22MgQpoy5M_o )
, you’re helping put pressure on Congress and equip yourself
with the latest resources to oppose this student loan overhaul
and protect yourself.

In Community,

Team SDCC

