February 9, 2026

Dear Supporter,

This month, we’re hosting several student loan workshops. We hope
you can join us to catch up on the latest updates, ask your
questions, and learn more!

📅 SAVE Workshop: Wed, Feb. 11 at 7 PM ET / 4 PM PT 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.4ldQ0ramg-FlrQgepO-djAJioPxHdIxQoZtK1K37cjilRM3w5paR5JqQw12i6O-1upFFAOtE0rSklR-LD8RRywgHvR8scCAyfVkWolR4b8U/4o1/YNO37KwHTwWRN0ItEGO5_Q/t0/h001.YuH5Ghj-TnSdnWbcdsTygObHQOPQPZ_4Z1yzGCJDBZg )


This workshop is specifically for folks enrolled in the SAVE
plan. With the SAVE Plan set to end in the coming months, join us
to learn about existing repayment plans & how to identify new
payment amounts, what to do if you are missing out on Public
Service Loan Forgiveness (PSLF) credits while enrolled in SAVE,
and who should take action now versus later.

📅 Default and Delinquency Workshop: Wed, Feb. 18 at 3 PM ET /
12 PM PT 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.4ldQ0ramg-FlrQgepO-djAJioPxHdIxQoZtK1K37cjilRM3w5paR5JqQw12i6O-1ObuwpQ3XudLN0SZrL-_mJUCLm7hHNSfU2kgfnfGt2WU/4o1/YNO37KwHTwWRN0ItEGO5_Q/t1/h001.KiB5JsiCBq32hXUhylMsMFul1W6s2-DFJThmOES35mc )


If you are behind on payments or have defaulted on your student
loans, this workshop will cover what your options are and how to
get your account back into good standing. SDCC will be joined by
special guests who will provide clear guidance and next steps
while helping answer your questions.

📅 General Workshop Email: Thu, Feb. 19 at 7 PM ET / 4 PM PT 
( https://redirect.moveon.org/ss/c/u001.4ldQ0ramg-FlrQgepO-djAJioPxHdIxQoZtK1K37cjilRM3w5paR5JqQw12i6O-16h7TCj7A6RhRio0e-gQF5ExoCFOA6rmMWBddvwKhAGI/4o1/YNO37KwHTwWRN0ItEGO5_Q/t2/h001.JoUCijMJY3HNYzXJBChDOMooNEgVWJ4jmAkSOj9mAYU )


Sign up for this workshop to receive a more generalized overview
of the student loan system. SDCC, along with a special guest,
will provide the latest student loan updates, explain repayment
options, and show you how to navigate the student loan system. If
you have any general student loan inquiries, this workshop is for
you!

Don’t wait! Sign up for our student loan workshops today before
it's too late.

In Community,

Team SDCC

